      "side": 0,
      "message": "Hi Etienne, nice to meet you.\n\nI understand and appreciate that MediaPlayerList is important to the AAOS experience.\n\nI don\u0027t actually understand how to access this functionality on my phone. When I disable this flag on my phone I don\u0027t see any perceptible difference as a user (except that my phone boots a lot faster and feels snappier). Could you direct me to understanding what functionality I stand to lose as a user by disabling this flag on my phone, and how I can see this?\n\nIs there a fast path forward here where we disable this feature on devices where it\u0027s inaccessible, or where the product owner simply doesn\u0027t see the added value?\n\nThere is precedent to this: device/google/clockwork/bluetooth/bluetooth.prop",
